
=== print_bio(character) ===
    { character:
        -normie:
            ~ normie_bio()
            
        -innocent:
            ~ innocent_bio()
            
        -hunter:
            ~ hunter_bio()
                      
        -thrall:
            ~ thrall_bio()
                 
        -douche:
            ~ douche_bio()
            
        - gym_bro: // MORE JUICE!
            ~ gym_bro_bio()
           
        - cryptid:
            ~ cryptid_bio()
           
        - former_flame:
            ~ former_flame_bio()
          
        - goth:
            ~ goth_bio()
            
        - cheater:
            ~ cheater_bio()
        ~ douche_bio()
           
    }
    ->->

    
=== function douche_bio()
{~ He's wearing a trucker cap backwards.|His fingers are knotted in a parody handsign.}
<> {~ An arm draped over a very drunk woman.|The fish he's holding has bulging, mad eyes.}
<> {~ His first message is a dick. Presumably his.|He sends you the eggplant emoji followed by several sprays of water.} [lore]
Dick Richardson [title]
Hit me up if you like swimming. [bio]
#Douche

=== function normie_bio()
{~ Golf shirt and chinos.|Lite beer set in front of a mediocre sunset.}
<> {~ A photo of him mid-golf swing.|Smiling awkwardly in a badly cropped group shot.}
<> A total normie. [lore]
Normie Title [title]
#Normie

=== function cheater_bio()
{~ No face pics and he doesn't want to meet in public. That suits you fine.|Only in town for a few days. He texts the address of a hotel.} [bio]
Cheater Title [title]
#Cheater


=== function hunter_bio()
{~ Buff but his eyes are haunted.| He's not looking for a date, he's looking for revenge.}
<> {~ The red flags you can't ignore.| } [lore]
#Hunter

