=== function innocent_bio()
{~ They have kind eyes. Too kind to survive in a world this cruel. Would it be kindness to spare them?|In one photo a bird is perched on her finger, she's smiling in pure delight.} [lore]
#Innocent

=== function thrall_bio()
{~ Handy with powertools. |Capable of walking in sunlight.| If he didn't have a service kink, he will soon.} [lore]
#Thrall


=== function gym_bro_bio()
{~ Those thick arms are nice. Especially the engorged veins wrapping them.|He'll taste like whey powder and sweat.} [lore]
#Gym Bro


=== function cryptid_bio()
{~ Its smile is too feral. |Its glittering skin too moist. That's not make up.} [lore]
#Cryptid


=== function vampire_bio()
{~ A glint of sharp teeth.|Her white skin is too white. She's sipping red wine. Oh... not wine.} [lore]
#Vampire

=== function goth_bio()
{~ They're excited to get bitten. You're not sure if they believe it's real or a kink thing.|A skinny body armored with black lace.} [lore]
#Goth

=== function former_flame_bio()
{~ You've crossed paths before.|You two had a little fun before it fizzled.}
<> One of you ghosted the other. Now one of you is really going to become a ghost. [lore]
 #Former Flame
